      "description": "Gordon Ramsay, dressed in a white chef's coat, is leaning forward with a displeased expression, looking at a plate of chicken. The scene is set in a restaurant kitchen or dining area, with text overlay humorously suggesting the chicken is so rubbery that Goodyear called for the recipe. The chef is the central focus, with food and restaurant elements surrounding him.",
